Configuration for VSPHERE Provider:

vSphere Provider Configuration:
  Required Credentials:
    - VSPHERE_SERVER
    - VSPHERE_USERNAME
    - VSPHERE_PASSWORD
  Required Settings:
    - VSPHERE_DATACENTER
    - VSPHERE_DATASTORE
    - VSPHERE_NETWORK
    - VSPHERE_RESOURCE_POOL
  Optional:
    - VSPHERE_FOLDER
    - VSPHERE_TEMPLATE (VM template to clone)

  Common Resources:
    - VSphereCluster: Manages cluster-level settings
    - VSphereMachine: Individual VM instances
    - VSphereMachineTemplate: Template for creating machines
